{
  "sourceId": "post-corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid-en",
  "locale": "en",
  "source": {
    "kind": "single-post",
    "postId": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "↵If you find your notebook has WiFi connectivity in a certain area but loses it in some areas with full WiFi signal, you may be under a faulty WiFi router.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "There are many routers in an office that share the same SSID so that your notebook determines the best WiFi router to connect with.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "However, some may fail over time.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The steps below may help if you connect to a faulty WiFi router nearby that allows you to connect but does not have proper Internet connectivity.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "First, use the command below to check which WiFi router you are connecting to:",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "<pre>$ netsh wlan show interface</pre>",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Take a look at the BSSID under SSID.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "SSID is an ID that could represent more than one WiFi router, but BSSID is the unique ID for a specific WiFi router:",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "<pre>There is 1 interface on the system:",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Name : Wireless Network Connection↵ Description : Intel(R) Centrino(R) Advanced-N 6205↵ GUID : d827d652-b7f5-412e-xxxx-1235ea895d99↵ Physical address : aa:aa:aa:aa:aa:aa↵ State : connected↵ SSID : ABC↵ BSSID : zz:zz:zz:zz:zz:zz↵ Network type : Infrastructure↵ Radio type : 802.11n↵ Authentication : WPA2-Personal↵ Cipher : CCMP↵ Connection mode : Auto Connect↵ Channel : 1↵ Receive rate (Mbps) : 144↵ Transmit rate (Mbps) : 144↵ Signal : 99%↵ Profile : ABC",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Hosted network status : Not started↵</pre>",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The notebook is connected to the WiFi network ABC via router zz:zz:zz:zz:zz:zz.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Are any other routers available under the SSID ABC?",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "<pre>$ netsh wlan show all</pre>",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Look for SHOW NETWORK MODE=BSSID from the result.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It shows all the routers available for WiFi network ABC:",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "<pre>=======================================================================↵======================= SHOW NETWORKS MODE=BSSID ======================↵=======================================================================",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "SSID 8 : ABC↵ Network type : Infrastructure↵ Authentication : WPA2-Personal↵ Encryption : CCMP↵ BSSID 1 : xx:xx:xx:xx:xx:xx↵ Signal : 80%↵ Radio type : 802.11n↵ Channel : 40↵ Basic rates (Mbps) : 6 12 24↵ Other rates (Mbps) : 9 18 36 48 54↵ BSSID 2 : yy:yy:yy:yy:yy:yy↵ Signal : 76%↵ Radio type : 802.11n↵ Channel : 161↵ Basic rates (Mbps) : 6 12 24↵ Other rates (Mbps) : 9 18 36 48 54↵ BSSID 3 : zz:zz:zz:zz:zz:zz↵ Signal : 99%↵ Radio type : 802.11n↵ Channel : 11↵ Basic rates (Mbps) : 6.5 16 19.5 117↵ Other rates (Mbps) : 18 19.5 24 36 39 48 54 156↵</pre>",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "There are 3 BSSIDs under SSID ABC, which means there are 3 WiFi routers in range when you are trying to connect to the WiFi network named ABC.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The WiFi router with the strongest signal to your notebook is used by default, as it can provide the best connectivity and transfer speed.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "However, the router with the strongest signal is not configured properly in this case.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "How do we force the notebook to connect to a router that is working although the signal is weaker?",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's say we want to connect to the router with BSSID xx:xx:xx:xx:xx:xx.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "* *",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In Windows, we can go to the Control Panel and manage your WiFi settings.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Right-click on the WiFi network that you want to connect with, and then select Properties.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In the Wireless Network Properties, check _Enable Intel connection settings_, then click Configure.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Select _Mandatory Access Point_, key in the BSSID that you want to connect with.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Click OK to save the settings.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It may be slower as you have poor connectivity due to poor signal strength, but you survive at least until someone fixes the issue.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The above option only works for Intel WiFi adapters.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "I do not know if other WiFi drivers provide the feature for enforcing BSSID.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Let me know if you have found it in another WiFi driver.↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "hasMore": false,
